flowchart TB
 ROOT["01 YOUR ONE NORMAL CLAUDE PROMPT"] --> LEAD["UBERMIND OMEGA 10 • SOVEREIGN DIRECTOR<br/>One lead Claude Pro session; source+quality+spend gates"]
 HIER["FOUNDER CONTINUUM<br/>Wessam Singularity • Personal Civilization • UberBond"] -. "Goals, authority, anti-amputation" .-> LEAD
 GEN["890 ORIGINAL FOUNDER IDEAS + GENESIS<br/>ten immutable shards, original wording, descendants separate"] -. "Relevant source pointers only" .-> CTX
 MEMORY["TOTAL BRAIN / PHOENIX / NEGATIVE KNOWLEDGE<br/>Error, provenance, evidence, successful verified procedures"] -. "W30 Hot18 imported kernel and on-demand context" .-> CTX
 CAP["CAPABILITY GENOME + SKILL IMMUNE SYSTEM<br/>Approved tools, security, licenses, task-class candidates"] -. "Minimum safe toolset" .-> CTX
 LEAD --> CTX["02 INTELLIGENCE ESCROW<br/>Source digest • accepted output contract • task delta"]
 CTX --> PRIOR{"03 EXACT CERTIFIED RESULT OR TOOL?"}
 PRIOR -- "YES: valid source + scope" --> CODE["NO NEW MODEL CALL<br/>E0–E4 certified cache/code/test/AST/solver"]
 PRIOR -- "NO: unsolved or changed" --> JEVQ{"04 TYPED JEV QUESTION AND SEPARATE AUTHORITY?"}
 JEVQ -- "YES, bounded and funded" --> JEV["JEV 1.13 HYPERREFLEX<br/>NOUL • CHOICE • SCORE; advisory only"]
 JEV --> TENSOR["Existing W11–W22 guarded tensor<br/>Scoped reuse • single-flight • budget • admission"]
 TENSOR --> JEVPROOF{"Scope-specific decision independently sufficient?"}
 JEVPROOF -- YES --> CODE
 JEVPROOF -- NO --> MARKET
 JEVQ -- "NO: strict $20 Pro" --> ROUTE["LOCAL RULED ROUTER • NO PAID JEV CALL"]
 ROUTE --> MARKET{"05 COGNITIVE PRESSURE VALVE<br/>Difficulty × consequences × quality × actual Pro quota"}
 MARKET -- "Read-only source scout" --> HAIKU["HAIKU 5.5 • SOURCE SCOUT<br/>Read/Grep/Glob; max 6 turns; no cold canon bulk"]
 MARKET -- "Normal implementation" --> SONNET["SONNET 5.5 • MAIN ENGINEER<br/>Single session; workflow-as-code; tests"]
 MARKET -- "Novel/critical uncertainty" --> OPUS["OPUS 5.5 • FRONTIER ARCHITECT<br/>One independent high-effort spec or adjudication"]
 HAIKU --> SPEC["06 CONTRACT COMPILER<br/>Interfaces • DAG • source SHA • owned paths • tests"]
 OPUS --> SPEC
 SPEC --> TEAM{"07 PARALLEL WORK NET POSITIVE AFTER TOKEN OVERHEAD?"}
 TEAM -- "NO, default" --> SONNET
 TEAM -- "YES, truly independent" --> BUS["OPTIONAL P2P TASK BUS<br/>Sonnet builder A • Sonnet adversarial tester B<br/>Haiku scout when source load justifies it"]
 BUS --> DIFF["08 PROOF-CARRYING DELTAS<br/>Changed files • unresolved claims • competing hypotheses"]
 SONNET --> DIFF
 DIFF --> DOUBT{"09 HARD SEMANTIC DISAGREEMENT PERSISTS?"}
 DOUBT -- NO --> REALITY
 DOUBT -- YES --> N2["N=2 DIVERSE HYPOTHESES<br/>Only if expected quality benefit exceeds usage"]
 N2 --> ESC{"Material unanswered error remains?"}
 ESC -- YES --> N4["Adaptive N=4 / N=8 ONLY IF JUSTIFIED<br/>Falsifier • evidence hunter • framebreaker"]
 ESC -- NO --> CROWN
 N4 --> CROWN["10 MOVING FRONTIER CROWN<br/>Opus on Pro if available; qualified others only with separate permission"]
 CROWN --> REALITY["11 REALITY COURT<br/>Independent tests • claimed vs proved output"]
 CODE --> REALITY
 REALITY --> ACCEPT{"12 SAME ACCEPTANCE QUALITY AND AUTHORITY?"}
 ACCEPT -- NO --> HOLD["HOLD / REPAIR / WAIT FOR LEGITIMATE QUOTA RESET"]
 ACCEPT -- YES --> OUTPUT["13 FINISHED DELIVERABLE / GOVERNED PR / VERIFIED EFFECT"]
 OUTPUT --> LEARN["14 COGNITIVE COMPOUND INTEREST<br/>Cognitive multicast • decision DAG reuse • Crown call coalescing<br/>Proof #57 • Error #58 • Prediction #59 • Civilization Git #61"]
 LEARN -. "Certified next-time reuse" .-> PRIOR
 LEARN -. "Failure and source receipt" .-> MEMORY
 LEARN -. "GENESIS successor hypothesis" .-> GEN
 OUTPUT --> BENCH["15 EXACT-TASK PAIRED COST-QUALITY LEDGER<br/>Same task hash + quality suite + accepted evidence<br/>Weekly Pro meter reduction; NOT theoretical price alone"]
 BENCH -. "Feedback on worker allocation" .-> MARKET
 BUDGET["CLAUDE PRO $20/MONTH<br/>Shared 5h + weekly limit; NO outside API spend"] -. "Budget ceiling" .-> LEAD
 SCREEN["TWITTER DEMO $0.47 -> $0.14 CLAIMED<br/>Different egg-drop task; unverified in our environment"] -. "Only external comparison reference" .-> BENCH
